	(text "LAYOUT: Module antenna at the board edge, antenna outside the board or a cut-out\n        on both sides (Espressif HDG sec. 1.4.8). Keep copper, parts and traces out of the keepout.\nLAYOUT: C1/C2 right at U1 pin 2 (3V3), via to GND at the cap pad.\nLAYOUT: C3/R1 close to U1 pin 3 (EN). C4-C8 close to the ESP32 ADC pins.\nLAYOUT: Thermal pad (pin 39): via array to the GND plane."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
